   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The imparfait for describing",
     "texto": [
      "It is used to say **what something was like** or **what used to happen** regularly: **Autrefois, j'habitais à Lyon** (in the past, I lived in Lyon).",
      "Compare with the present: **J'habite à Lyon** (I live in Lyon, now)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How it is formed",
     "texto": [
      "Take the **nous** form of the present and remove **-ons**. Then add these endings: **-ais, -ais, -ait, -ions, -iez, -aient**.",
      "Example: **nous parlons** → **parl-** → **je parlais**.",
      "The exception is **être**, which uses the stem **ét-**: **j'étais, tu étais, il était**…"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two spelling changes",
     "texto": [
      "With verbs ending in **-ger**, the **e** is kept before **a**: **nous mangeons** → **je mangeais**. With verbs ending in **-cer**, the **c** becomes **ç** before **a**: **nous commençons** → **je commençais**. The soft pronunciation is kept."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "The imparfait",
